"| Max-3-Cut Karate Club | 99        | 33          | 99     | 98.7%    | True        | 279.5             | 166.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
"| Max-4-Cut Karate Club | 132       | 33          | 132    | 100.0%   | True        | 258.3             | 200.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Problema              | Mga Variable | Mga Constraint | Mga Qubit | Accuracy | Feasibility | Kabuuang runtime (s) | Paggamit ng QPU (s) | Kabuuang shots |\n"
"|-----------------------|-----------|-------------|--------|----------|-------------|-------------------|---------------|-------------|\n"
