msgid "Changelog {#changelog}"
msgstr "Talaan ng mga Pagbabago {#changelog}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "[0.4.5] - 2026-10-30 {#045---2026-10-30}"
msgstr "[0.4.5] - 2026-10-30 {#045---2026-10-30}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Improvements**\n"
"- Improved the stability of the warm-start update by adaptively rescaling the Boltzmann weighting in each iteration.\n"
"- Improved the `epsilon` regularization of the warm-start probabilities, which now applies consistently to single variables and one-hot groups. Its valid range is now `[0.01, 0.5]`, where `0.5` yields the equal superposition.\n"
"- Circuits are now placed on a low-error region of the backend, based on its current calibration data, instead of on the coupling map alone.\n"
"- Dynamical decoupling (XpXm) and measurement twirling are now enabled for all circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga Pagpapabuti**\n"
"- Pinahusay ang katatagan ng warm-start update sa pamamagitan ng adaptive na pag-rescale ng Boltzmann weighting sa bawat iteration.\n"
"- Pinahusay ang `epsilon` regularization ng mga warm-start probability, na ngayon ay pare-parehong naaangkop sa mga single variable at one-hot group. Ang valid range nito ay `[0.01, 0.5]` na ngayon, kung saan ang `0.5` ay nagbibigay ng equal superposition.\n"
"- Ang mga circuit ay inilalagay na ngayon sa low-error na rehiyon ng backend, batay sa kasalukuyang calibration data nito, sa halip na sa coupling map lamang.\n"
"- Naka-enable na ngayon ang dynamical decoupling (XpXm) at measurement twirling para sa lahat ng circuit.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "[0.4.3] - 2026-10-12 {#043---2026-10-12}"
msgstr "[0.4.3] - 2026-10-12 {#043---2026-10-12}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Improvements**\n"
"- Improved Hamiltonian rescaling by normalizing with the root-mean-square (RMS) of the energy deltas.\n"
"- Improved the derivation of penalty weights for set-packing constraints.\n"
"- Improved routing for coloring-type problems.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga Pagpapabuti**\n"
"- Pinahusay ang Hamiltonian rescaling sa pamamagitan ng pag-normalize gamit ang root-mean-square (RMS) ng mga energy delta.\n"
"- Pinahusay ang pagkuha ng mga penalty weight para sa mga set-packing constraint.\n"
"- Pinahusay ang routing para sa mga problemang coloring-type.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "[0.4.0] - 2026-09-22 {#040---2026-09-22}"
msgstr "[0.4.0] - 2026-09-22 {#040---2026-09-22}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-30 · verified 2026-10-01
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Breaking changes**\n"
"- Renamed the input parameter `model` to `problem`.\n"
"- Renamed the output field `obj_value` to `objective_value`.\n"
"- Replaced the `postprocessing` option with `postprocessing_level`, which takes an integer in the range `[0, 3]` instead of a string. The previous values map to `\"off\"` -> `0`, `\"weak\"` -> `1`, `\"medium\"` -> `2`, and `\"strong\"` -> `3`, and the default is unchanged at `3`.\n"
"- Restructured `metadata.circuit_metrics`. It now reports `num_qubits`, `gate_count`, `depth`, `two_qubit_gate_count`, `two_qubit_gate_depth`, and `operations` separately for `before_transpilation` and `after_transpilation`, instead of a single flat dictionary of averaged gate counts. The field is `None` when the problem was solved during preprocessing and no circuit was run (error code `4712`).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga breaking change**\n"
"- Pinalitan ang pangalan ng input parameter na `model` para maging `problem`.\n"
"- Pinalitan ang pangalan ng output field na `obj_value` para maging `objective_value`.\n"
"- Pinalitan ang opsyong `postprocessing` ng `postprocessing_level`, na tumatanggap ng integer sa saklaw na `[0, 3]` sa halip na string. Ang mga dating value ay nagmamapa sa `\"off\"` -> `0`, `\"weak\"` -> `1`, `\"medium\"` -> `2`, at `\"strong\"` -> `3`, at hindi nagbago ang default na `3`.\n"
"- Inayos muli ang istruktura ng `metadata.circuit_metrics`. Ngayon ay nag-uulat ito ng `num_qubits`, `gate_count`, `depth`, `two_qubit_gate_count`, `two_qubit_gate_depth`, at `operations` nang hiwalay para sa `before_transpilation` at `after_transpilation`, sa halip na isang flat na dictionary ng mga average na gate count. Ang field ay `None` kapag nalutas ang problema habang preprocessing at walang circuit na pinatakbo (error code `4712`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-30 · verified 2026-10-01
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Features**\n"
"- Added the `seed_transpiler` option to make circuit synthesis and routing reproducible across runs.\n"
"- Added the `job_tags` option to attach your own tags to every Qiskit Runtime job the function submits.\n"
"- Added the output field `solution_bitstrings`, which returns the same solutions as `solutions` in bitstring form.\n"
"- Added `metadata.solver_info.variable_mapping`, which maps each variable name to its character position in the entries of `solution_bitstrings`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mga feature**\n"
"- Idinagdag ang opsyong `seed_transpiler` para maging reproducible ang circuit synthesis at routing sa bawat takbo.\n"
"- Idinagdag ang opsyong `job_tags` para maglagay ng sarili mong mga tag sa bawat Qiskit Runtime job na isinusumite ng function.\n"
"- Idinagdag ang output field na `solution_bitstrings`, na nagbabalik ng parehong mga solusyon gaya ng `solutions` sa anyong bitstring.\n"
"- Idinagdag ang `metadata.solver_info.variable_mapping`, na nagmamapa ng bawat pangalan ng variable sa posisyon ng karakter nito sa mga entry ng `solution_bitstrings`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-30 · verified 2026-10-01
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Documentation**\n"
"- Documented that continuous (real-valued) variables are not supported and that integer variables require explicit bounds. Such models fail with error code `4710`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Dokumentasyon**\n"
"- Idinokumento na hindi sinusuportahan ang mga continuous (real-valued) na variable at na kailangan ng tahasang bound ng mga integer variable. Pumapalya ang ganoong mga modelo na may error code na `4710`.\n"

